DESCRIPTION:The DC Improv Comedy School is proud to present a stand-up clas
 s graduation showcase. Students who have completed the "Five Minutes to Fun
 ny" stand-up course will be taking the famous DC Improv stage to show what 
 they learned. Check out this showcase and enjoy what's sure to be a memorab
 le time for everyone involved.\n\nThe lineup for October 7: TBA\n\nAll sale
 s are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when a show is canceled
  or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to at
 tend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted i
 n the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per customer. This
  can be any combination of food items or beverages. Bottled water and soft 
 drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does not apply to comedy class
 es.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be used for a show list
 ed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nThis show will be seated by
  time of arrival. The earlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have. Pl
 ease note that the size of your party can affect what options are available
  to you\, as certain tables and areas are designated for larger parties.\n\
 nIf tickets are designated as being at a "reserved table\," your party will
  have a table to itself. For general admission tickets\, if your party does
  not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\
 nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/comedy-school-gradua
 tion-showcase/
